My opinion, for what it is worth (I don't have a veto), is that if this=20
is an actual change to the morphology as it was defined fora couple of=20
decades, then the fact that Jorge has to raise such questions means that=20
the proposal was not specified completely enough to be properly debated,=20
much less decided.

Especially knowing that Jorge could read any recorded=20
discussion/proposal in Lojban, unlike many of the rest of us (including=20
Nora who did much of the later work and explication of morphology issues).

I also don't recall any mention of this as a proposal approved by byfy,=20
and reported to the members or the Board by the byfy jatna

This proposal should not be incorporated into CLL without a proper=20
documentation, discussion and decision.  There is no evidence that such=20
has taken place.

